# Git Integration
##  Jenkins Pipeline — Checkout Git
how to **checkout a Git repository** and list files.

pipeline {
    agent any
    stages {
        stage('Checkout') {
            steps {
                git branch: 'main', url: 'https://github.com/mycollege/sample-java-app.git'
            }
        }
        stage('List Files') {
            steps {
                sh 'ls -la'
            }
        }
    }
}

##  GitLab CI — Checkout Git
how to **checkout a Git repository in GitLab CI**.

stages:
  - checkout

git-checkout:
  stage: checkout
  script:
    - git clone https://github.com/mycollege/sample-java-app.git
    - cd sample-java-app
    - ls -la
